<section class="studio-intro wrap"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> LOOM STUDIO / A REAL APPLICATION</div><h1>让每一个想法，<br><span class="accent">向前一步。</span></h1><p>记录值得做的事，把进展交给时间。<br>一个有账号、有记忆、会在后台工作的轻量工作室。</p></div><div class="studio-note"><span class="mono">SMALL STEPS. REAL PROGRESS.</span><div class="studio-orbit" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><p>从今天的一件小事开始。</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap studio-shell" id="studio-app">
    <div id="studio-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div id="studio-auth" hidden>
        <div class="studio-auth-copy"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR OWN LITTLE CORNER</div><h2>为你的想法，<br>留一个位置。</h2><p>创建个人账号，开始记录任务。<br>你的清单和摘要只属于你。</p><ol><li>写下想完成的事</li><li>在后台生成进展摘要</li><li>让周期任务替你记住节奏</li></ol><a class="text-link" href="/guide#fullstack">看看它如何运转 →</a></div>
        <form id="studio-auth-form" class="studio-card"><div class="studio-mode"><button type="button" data-auth-mode="register" aria-pressed="true">创建账号</button><button type="button" data-auth-mode="login" aria-pressed="false">登录</button></div><label id="studio-name-label">如何称呼你<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80" required placeholder="你的名字"></label><label>邮箱<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" maxlength="254" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>密码<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" maxlength="72" required placeholder="至少 10 个字符"></label><button class="button primary" type="submit" id="studio-auth-submit">创建我的工作室 ↗</button><p class="studio-hint">账号与数据保存在当前服务的 SQLite 数据库中。</p></form>
    </div>
    <div id="studio-workspace" hidden>
        <div class="studio-toolbar"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE</div><h2 id="studio-greeting">今天，继续创造。</h2></div><button class="studio-quiet" id="studio-logout" type="button">退出登录 ↗</button></div>
        <div class="studio-stats"><div><span>所有任务</span><strong id="studio-total">0</strong></div><div><span>已经完成</span><strong id="studio-completed">0</strong></div><div><span>仍待探索</span><strong id="studio-open">0</strong></div></div>
        <section class="studio-card studio-projects"><div class="studio-card-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">GIVE YOUR IDEAS A HOME</div><h3>让相关的事，自然聚在一起。</h3></div><span class="mono">MODEL → RELATION → QUERY</span></div><div class="studio-project-controls"><label>查看项目<select id="studio-project-filter"><option value="">全部任务</option></select></label><form id="studio-project-form"><label for="studio-project-name">创建项目</label><div class="studio-add"><input id="studio-project-name" required maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：下一次发布"><button class="button primary" type="submit">创建 ↗</button></div></form></div><p class="studio-hint" id="studio-relation-note">项目与任务通过 ORM 关联。选择项目，查询该项目下的任务。</p><details><summary>这次查询如何表达？</summary><pre class="guide-code" id="studio-query-code">StudioTask::query()->where('user_id', '=', $userId)->orderBy('id', 'DESC')->rows();</pre></details></section>
        <div class="studio-columns"><section class="studio-card"><div class="studio-card-title"><h3>值得做的事</h3><span class="mono">01 / TASKS</span></div><form id="studio-task-form"><label class="sr-only" for="studio-title">新任务</label><div class="studio-add"><input id="studio-title" name="title" maxlength="240" required placeholder="写下一件想完成的事…"><button class="button primary" type="submit">添加 ↗</button></div><label class="studio-task-project">放入项目<select id="studio-task-project"><option value="">暂不归类</option></select></label></form><ul id="studio-tasks" class="studio-task-list"></ul><p class="studio-hint">勾选完成。刷新页面，进展依然在这里。统计对应当前项目筛选。</p></section>
        <aside class="studio-card studio-sage"><div class="studio-card-title"><h3>给进展，一次回望。</h3><span class="mono">02 / REFLECT</span></div><p>让后台任务统计你的全部任务，生成一份此刻的进展摘要。</p><div class="studio-report-actions"><button class="button primary" id="studio-report" type="button">生成摘要 ↗</button><button class="studio-quiet" id="studio-delayed" type="button">10 秒后生成</button></div><label class="studio-schedule"><input type="checkbox" id="studio-schedule"> 启用自动摘要</label><p class="studio-hint" id="studio-schedule-note">在下方设置 Cron 节奏，或随时暂停。</p><div id="studio-reports"></div></aside></div>
        <section class="studio-card studio-cron"><div class="studio-card-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">A RHYTHM OF YOUR OWN</div><h3>把回望，安排在恰好的时刻。</h3></div><span class="mono">03 / CRON</span></div><p>Cron 决定何时发生，队列负责可靠执行。先预览，再保存你的摘要节奏。</p><div class="studio-presets"><button type="button" data-cron="* * * * *">每分钟 · 体验</button><button type="button" data-cron="0 18 * * 1-5">工作日 18:00</button><button type="button" data-cron="0 9 * * 1">周一 09:00</button></div><form id="studio-cron-form"><div class="studio-cron-fields"><label>五字段表达式<input id="studio-cron-expression" required value="* * * * *" maxlength="100" spellcheck="false"><small>分 · 时 · 日 · 月 · 周</small></label><label>运行时区<select id="studio-cron-zone"><option>Asia/Shanghai</option><option>UTC</option><option>America/New_York</option><option>Europe/London</option></select></label></div><div class="studio-report-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">预览接下来五次 ↗</button><button class="studio-quiet" id="studio-cron-save" type="button">保存并启用</button></div></form><ol id="studio-cron-preview" class="studio-cron-preview" aria-live="polite"></ol><p id="studio-cron-current" class="studio-hint">尚未保存规则。</p></section>
        <section class="studio-card studio-migrations"><div class="studio-card-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">CHANGE, WITH A MEMORY</div><h3>每一次成长，都有迹可循。</h3></div><span class="mono">04 / MIGRATIONS</span></div><p>这个数据库从任务清单升级到了项目关系。版本、批次与应用时间，都有真实记录。</p><div id="studio-migration-history"></div><div class="studio-migration-demo"><div><strong>亲手走一遍升级与回滚</strong><p class="studio-hint">在独立临时数据库中创建表、升级、回滚、制造失败再恢复。你的工作室数据不会被修改。</p></div><button class="button primary" id="studio-migration-demo" type="button">运行迁移实验 ↗</button></div><ol id="studio-migration-events" aria-live="polite"></ol></section>
        <section class="studio-card studio-queue"><div class="studio-card-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">WORKING BEHIND THE SCENES</div><h3>有条不紊地，在后台发生。</h3></div><span class="studio-hint" id="studio-sync">正在同步</span></div><p>查看最近 12 个任务的排队、执行与完成状态。页面每三秒更新一次。</p><div id="studio-jobs" class="studio-job-list"></div></section>
    </div>
    <noscript><p>工作台交互需要 JavaScript。开发指南和展示页面仍可直接阅读。</p></noscript>
</section>
<section class="wrap studio-under"><div><span class="eyebrow">A COMPLETE LITTLE SYSTEM</span><h2>看起来简单。<br>背后，每一环都真实。</h2></div><div><p>登录会话 → 私有清单 → SQLite → 持久化队列 → 独立 PHP 任务 → 进展摘要。</p><a class="text-link" href="/guide#fullstack">阅读这条完整链路 →</a></div></section>
